# Detective's Satchel: "if you've sacrificed an artifact this turn" counts only the Satchel's controller's sacrifices. Turn 1 Bot1 casts it with Black Lotus and Mox Ruby (the Lotus's sacrifice is
# turn 1's, long over) and leaves Mox Jet and Mox Pearl untapped. Turn 2 Bot2 sacrifices its own Clue (the Thraben Inspector's, {2} from Mox Jet and Plains): the Satchel is refused. Bot1 then sacrifices
# its own Clue ({2} from its two Moxen, with Bot2's ability still on the stack) and the Satchel, which is no creature and is untapped, makes a Thopter on its opponent's turn (CR 602.5b).

